# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
# SOPS-encrypted tfvars ARE tracked despite the blanket rule above -
# see docs/decisions/0003-sops-age-secrets.md
!*.sops.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
*tfplan*
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Sensitive generated configs (Talos/Kubernetes)
**/kubeconfig
**/talosconfig

# Ansible
*.retry

# Secrets / env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# OS specific files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log
